<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n214" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄβῡδος</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Abydos,</i> on the Asiatic side of
			the Hellespont:— <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀβυδόθεν</span></b> , Adv.
			<i>from Abydos,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.500
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀβυδόθι</span></b> , <i>at
				Abydos,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				17.584
			</span></i>:—Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀβυδηνός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<i>of</i> or <i>from Abydos,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				13.572e
			</span></i>, etc.: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀ.
			ἐπιφόρημα</span> a dessert <i>of Abydos,</i> i.e.
				<i>something unpleasant,</i> variously expl., <i><span class="en">
				Zen.
				1.1
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ εἰκῆ τὴν
			Ἄβυδον</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατεῖν</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Paus.Gr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				2
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀβυδοκόμης</span></b> 
				(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀβυδηνοκώμης</span> or 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κόμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Zen.
					1.1
				</span></i>
			), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
				δ&lt;&gt;</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ ἐπὶ τὧ συκοφαντεῖν
				κομῶν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				733
			</span></i>.</div>
